      "stability": "session",
      "tokens": 158,
      "active": true,
      "body": "<reference>\nAdditional Workspace Roots\n\nBesides the primary workspace root, this session is also admitted to these directories (cross-project access is intended and sandbox-approved):\n  - /data/projects/sibling\n\nFile tools and shell commands may read and write there. Project-relative conventions (skills, extensions, `.nuo/config.toml`) still bind to the primary root only.\n</reference>"
